# Staging directory used by the OLD deploy flow, which copied the PDF engine in from a checkout
# outside this repo. Nothing writes here now — the engine is tracked at engine/pdf-analyser
# (ADR 0029), the same way the Office analysers are owned under engine/office-analysers
# (ADR 0012). Kept ignored so a stale local copy from a previous deploy is never committed.
deploy/public/vendor/

# Partner code (DigitalA11y) full upstream solution — its own repo, not tracked here.
# The live-path analyser projects are OWNED and vendored under engine/office-analysers/
# (ADR 0012); only this full working clone stays ignored.
digital-accessibility/
